  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Underwear for Needy Boys in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Underwear is the most needed items of all clothing.  Many boys especially those from low income parents are deprived of underwear and lots of them wear worn and torn undies. Hardly would you find children from needy homes in Africa having more than one or two underwear and had to wear for two or three days and wash overnight to wear again the following day. We&apos;re fundraising to buy new boxers at wholesale and distribute to needy boys to boost their self-esteem and promote good underwear hygiene.</narrative>
  </description>
